    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Employment Plan of Action, under the youth Employment Policy Implementation Plan approved</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This refers to the official approval of the Youth Employment Plan of Action, which is a key component of the broader Youth Employment Policy Implementation Plan. It outlines concrete actions, timelines, and responsible actors to put the policy into practice, focusing on creating jobs, improving skills, and addressing barriers faced by young people in the labor market.</narrative>
    </description>
